<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Casa Autrey cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Casa Autrey cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Thursday it had downgraded its rating for Mexican pharmaceutical wholesaler Grupo Casa Autrey to market outperform from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company fell 5/8 to 18-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
